        <mxCell id="admin-scope" value="Admin Scope and Failures&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed collection cap: 10,000 NFTs.&lt;br&gt;Fixed lifetime mint limit: 5 per wallet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mint proceeds and market pending funds are separate. This admin entry withdraws mint proceeds only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No proceeds or failed payment causes rejection / revert. A failed payment preserves mint proceeds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use Diagram 03 for rejection, transaction failure, or refresh errors." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
